        <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;@startuml\nautonumber\n\n&#39; =========================================================\n&#39; CẤU HÌNH GIAO DIỆN\n&#39; =========================================================\n\nskinparam backgroundColor white\nskinparam defaultFontName \&quot;Times New Roman\&quot;\nskinparam defaultFontSize 13\n\n&#39; Màu chủ đạo giống hình mẫu\nskinparam sequence {\n    ArrowColor #D6336C\n    ArrowFontColor #333333\n\n    LifeLineBorderColor #D6336C\n    LifeLineBackgroundColor white\n\n    ParticipantBorderColor #D6336C\n    ParticipantBackgroundColor #FFFACD\n\n    ActorBorderColor #D6336C\n    ActorBackgroundColor white\n\n    GroupBorderColor #777777\n    GroupBackgroundColor white\n\n    BoxBorderColor #D6336C\n    BoxBackgroundColor white\n\n    DividerBackgroundColor white\n    DividerBorderColor #777777\n}\n\n&#39; =========================================================\n&#39; CẤU HÌNH CÁC LOẠI ĐỐI TƯỢNG\n&#39; =========================================================\n\nskinparam actor {\n    BackgroundColor white\n    BorderColor #D6336C\n    FontColor #333333\n}\n\nskinparam boundary {\n    BackgroundColor #FFFACD\n    BorderColor #D6336C\n    FontColor #333333\n}\n\nskinparam control {\n    BackgroundColor #FFFACD\n    BorderColor #D6336C\n    FontColor #333333\n}\n\nskinparam entity {\n    BackgroundColor #FFFACD\n    BorderColor #D6336C\n    FontColor #333333\n}\n\nskinparam database {\n    BackgroundColor #FFFACD\n    BorderColor #D6336C\n    FontColor #333333\n}\n\n&#39; =========================================================\n&#39; CÁC ĐỐI TƯỢNG\n&#39; =========================================================\n\nactor \&quot;Khách hàng\&quot; as Customer\n\nboundary \&quot;frmThanhToan\&quot; as UI\n\ncontrol \&quot;OrderService\&quot; as Service\n\nentity \&quot;PaymentAdapter\&quot; as Payment\n\ndatabase \&quot;Db\&quot; as DB\n\nboundary \&quot;EmailAdapter\&quot; as Email\n\n\n&#39; =========================================================\n&#39; LUỒNG XỬ LÝ THANH TOÁN\n&#39; =========================================================\n\nCustomer -&gt; UI : Click \&quot;Thanh toán\&quot;\n\nUI -&gt; Service : ProcessOrder(cart, shippingInfo, cardInfo)\nactivate Service\n\nService -&gt; Service : CalculateShippingFee(total, deliveryType, area)\n\nService -&gt; Payment : VerifyAndPay(cardInfo, totalAmount)\nactivate Payment\n\nPayment --&gt; Service : Result (Success = True)\n\ndeactivate Payment\n\n\n&#39; =========================================================\n&#39; THANH TOÁN THÀNH CÔNG / THẤT BẠI\n&#39; =========================================================\n\nalt Thanh toán thành công\n\n    &#39; -----------------------------------------------------\n    &#39; Lưu đơn hàng vào database\n    &#39; -----------------------------------------------------\n\n    Service -&gt; DB : BeginTransaction()\n    activate DB\n\n    Service -&gt; DB : ExecuteInsertDonHang(...)\n\n    Service -&gt; DB : ExecuteInsertChiTietDonHang(...)\n\n    Service -&gt; DB : CommitTransaction()\n\n    DB --&gt; Service : Transaction OK\n\n    deactivate DB\n\n\n    &#39; -----------------------------------------------------\n    &#39; Gửi email xác nhận\n    &#39; -----------------------------------------------------\n\n    opt Khách hàng có cung cấp Email\n\n        Service -&gt; Email : SendOrderConfirmation(email, orderDetails)\n\n        activate Email\n\n        Email --&gt; Service : Sent Success\n\n        deactivate Email\n\n    end\n\n\n    &#39; -----------------------------------------------------\n    &#39; Trả kết quả thành công\n    &#39; -----------------------------------------------------\n\n    Service --&gt; UI : ProcessResult(Success = True, MaDH)\n\n    UI --&gt; Customer : Hiển thị \&quot;Đặt hàng thành công! Mã đơn: DHxxx\&quot;\n\n\nelse Thanh toán thất bại\n\n    &#39; -----------------------------------------------------\n    &#39; Trả kết quả thất bại\n    &#39; -----------------------------------------------------\n\n    Service --&gt; UI : ProcessResult(Success = False, ErrorMsg)\n\n    UI --&gt; Customer : Báo lỗi thanh toán &amp; Cho phép nhập lại thẻ\n\nend\n\n\ndeactivate Service\n\n@enduml\n&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="_NArDCX5BKFIIA72ve8Z-700">
          <mxCell connectable="0" parent="1" style="group;transparentBounds=1;editIcon=1;lockedGroup=0;groupPadding=10;" vertex="1">
            <mxGeometry as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
